---
title: Brave is Still the Best Browser
date: October 11th, 2026
unlisted: true
---

Recently I have been giving [Helium](https://helium.computer/) a try.
I really like the lack of bloat compared to Brave. 
[I like that it comes with uBlock Origin.](/writings/every-browser-should-come-with-adblock/)
I would use it as my main browser except for one issue:
Helium lacks sync.

I tried to live without it. I set up VaultWarden. I imported my extensions from Brave. The experience was good enougth,
until I got a new computer.

[I recently got a Mac.](#)



- brave has sync
- you can install ublock via going to manifestv2 extensions in settings
